{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Your lights are on, but you’re not home
[C]Your mind is not your own
[G]Your heart sweats, your body shakes
[D]Another kiss is what it takes
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
You can’t sleep, you can’t eat
There’s no doubt – you’re in deep
Your throat is tight, you can’t breathe
Another kiss is all you need
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Whoa, [Bm]you like to think that you’re [G]immune to the stuff, [D]oh yeah
It’s [Bm]closer to the truth to say you [G]can’t get enough
You know you're [G]gonna have to face it, you’re addicted to love
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
You see the signs, but you can't read
You're running at a different speed
Another kiss and you'll be mine
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
A one-track mind, you can't be saved
Oblivion is all you crave
If there's some left for you
You don't mind if you do
{end_of_verse}

